Support read-only application assets and a separate writable data directory.

ASSETS_DIR selects the directory containing dist/client/browser and proto,
while DATABASE_DIR holds runtime configuration and backup/restore files as
well as the database and encryption key. Resolve the HTML template when the
middleware is initialized so settings loaded from .env are honored.

Use Node's built-in .env loader in the startup script, avoiding a runtime
dependency on the development-only dotenv package. Allow the tested Node.js
24.22.2 release alongside the existing Node.js 22 range.

